{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-turtle-care#card-zh","repo":"uckkk/dsh-turtle-care","commit":"2aade777b103999fff82d44d0825d3a7709be2d9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-turtle-care 是一个面向 DSH 的乌龟饲养工具插件。它向 DSH tools 注册 turtle_care，按龟种返回饲养环境、用水、饮食和注意事项建议。工具覆盖巴西龟、草龟或中华龟、陆龟、猪鼻龟和蛋龟；未识别的类型会回退到巴西龟方案。适合需要在会话中快速查询常见养龟要点的饲养者。调用时可传入龟种 type；不需要额外配置或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:7-24"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-turtle-care#card-en","repo":"uckkk/dsh-turtle-care","commit":"2aade777b103999fff82d44d0825d3a7709be2d9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-turtle-care adds a turtle care tool to DSH. It returns habitat, water, diet, and care tips for sliders, Chinese pond turtles, tortoises, pig-nosed turtles, and musk turtles. Unknown types use the slider guide. Pass a type for a structured reference; no extra setup or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:7-24"]}
