{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-turtle-care#feature-1","repo":"uckkk/dsh-turtle-care","commit":"2aade777b103999fff82d44d0825d3a7709be2d9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-turtle-care 的功能「Species guide」：该工具接受龟种 type 参数，并为巴西龟、草龟或中华龟、陆龟、猪鼻龟和蛋龟返回对应饲养建议；未匹配的输入使用巴西龟默认方案。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:7-24"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-turtle-care#feature-2","repo":"uckkk/dsh-turtle-care","commit":"2aade777b103999fff82d44d0825d3a7709be2d9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-turtle-care 的功能「Habitat and water」：按所选龟种给出饲养环境和水体建议，例如晒台、陆龟箱、深水缸或水深要求，帮助用户快速查看基础布置方向。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:7-24"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-turtle-care#feature-3","repo":"uckkk/dsh-turtle-care","commit":"2aade777b103999fff82d44d0825d3a7709be2d9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-turtle-care 的功能「Diet and care notes」：工具返回龟种对应的饮食建议与提示，并附带通用晒太阳、水质清洁和冬眠管理要点，结果以结构化字段输出。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:7-24"]}
